---
description: Never add Cursor Co-authored-by attribution to commits or PRs
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor commit / PR attribution

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com`, "Coauthored by Cursor", or any similar Cursor attribution to commit messages, PR bodies, or other project text.
- When creating commits or pull requests, omit agent attribution trailers entirely.
- If a tool or UI offers to attribute commits/PRs to the agent, leave that disabled / do not include it.
